### Variables (REST Client / IntelliJ HTTP)
@base = http://localhost:8000
@settlement = <settlement-asset-account-id>
@customerA = <customer-a-account-id>
@customerB = <customer-b-account-id>
@feeIncome = <fee-income-account-id>

### Liveness / readiness
GET {{base}}/health/ready

### Create a settlement asset account
POST {{base}}/api/v1/accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{"account_name": "Cash / Settlement GBP", "account_type": "ASSET", "currency": "GBP"}

### Create a customer liability account
POST {{base}}/api/v1/accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{"account_name": "Synthetic Customer A", "account_type": "LIABILITY", "currency": "GBP"}

### Fund the customer (balanced journal entry)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/journal-entries
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: dep-demo-0001

{
  "reference": "DEP-DEMO-0001",
  "description": "Synthetic deposit",
  "booking_date": "2026-10-13",
  "postings": [
    {"account_id": "{{settlement}}", "direction": "DEBIT", "amount": "1000.00", "currency": "GBP"},
    {"account_id": "{{customerA}}", "direction": "CREDIT", "amount": "1000.00", "currency": "GBP"}
  ]
}

### Transfer (retry-safe thanks to the Idempotency-Key)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/transfers
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: trf-demo-0001

{
  "source_account_id": "{{customerA}}",
  "destination_account_id": "{{customerB}}",
  "amount": "250.00",
  "currency": "GBP",
  "reference": "TRF-DEMO-0001",
  "value_date": "2026-10-13"
}

### Balance
GET {{base}}/api/v1/accounts/{{customerA}}/balance

### Trial balance
GET {{base}}/api/v1/reconciliation/trial-balance?currency=GBP

### Search entries touching customer A
GET {{base}}/api/v1/journal-entries?account_id={{customerA}}&limit=20

### Reverse an entry
POST {{base}}/api/v1/journal-entries/<journal-id>/reverse
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: rev-demo-0001

{"reason": "Fee charged in error"}
